cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these artefacts, please cite the journal article; if you use the artefacts themselves, please also cite the archived release."
title: "IncidentMind — evaluation artefacts"
abstract: >-
  Code, data and results reproducing every table, figure and quantitative claim in
  "Precedent-Grounded Counterfactual Estimation of Recovery Decision Outcomes in
  Cloud-Native Systems": a frozen generative testbed supplying counterfactual
  ground truth, a reference estimator with seven executed baselines, never-inspected
  split audits, and a Kubernetes fault-injection campaign.
type: software
